What survives of the family's papers, photographs and keepsakes, and who looks after them as of this printing. Items remembered but now lost are listed too, so no one spends years looking.

== Documents

*Ruth's nursing-school diploma* (1959). Mentioned in conversation; not yet seen. Kept by unknown. _The school's alumni office may hold a copy._

== Recordings

*The original interview recordings* (2024). Two sessions recorded by Sam Calder. Kept by Sam Calder, the family.
